    {
      "id": "silk-mara",
      "name": "Silk Mara",
      "species": "Half-Elf",
      "gender": "Female",
      "age": 29,
      "occupation": "Pickpocket",
      "category": "criminal",
      "tags": [
        "thief",
        "crowd",
        "fleet"
      ],
      "description": "Silk holds down crowded market aisles with callused competence and open ears.",
      "biography": "Walk into crowded market aisles and you will find Silk Mara before you find a free chair. A 29-year-old Half-Elf pickpocket, Silk greets trouble the way other folk greet weather: with a coat and a plan. She apologizes while she steals. The fingerless gloves with silk palms travels with her almost everywhere. Works for Rook; sells extras to Kitty. Her ambition is to exit the life with one perfect score. Her nightmare is Rook deciding she's a liability. Right now, Lifted Lina's note about Lysa's ring and sold the tip to Kitty.",
      "personality": "Warm with regulars, curt with wasters; apologizes while she steals.",
      "motivation": "Secure enough ground to exit the life with one perfect score.",
      "secret": "Quietly arranging matters around this problem: Lifted Lina's note about Lysa's ring and sold the tip to Kitty.",
      "rumor": "Someone paid Silk to forget a name connected to recent trouble near crowded market aisles.",
      "voice": "Polite public voice; sharper private asides when trust appears.",
      "appearance": "Looks like someone who sleeps lightly; distinctive detail is the fingerless gloves with silk palms.",
