      "description": "The forgery clerk people recommend when they actually want the job finished.",
      "biography": "People looking for a reliable forgery clerk are often sent to Pale, who claims a desk piled with blank forms as familiar ground. At 43, this Human has learned to watch hands before faces. He washes ink from his hands until they crack; neighbors joke that he would miss a festival before misplacing the set of copied seals in clay. Forger for Rook; nervous around Penna. He is saving courage and coin alike to forge one document that buys him out forever, while trying not to let Penna Ledgerwell recognizing his pen pressure decide the ending. Drafted a fake warehouse writ used in Rook's last shipment.",
